# Architecture — dual CA + US

- Astro affiliate site. Two indexable hosts from one repo:
  - `https://thepickleballcourt.ca` — Cloudflare Pages `the-pickleball-court-ca`, `npm run build:ca`
  - `https://uspickleballcourt.com` — Cloudflare Pages `the-pickleball-court`, `npm run build:us`
- `site` / affiliate tag / Amazon host come from `PUBLIC_SITE_REGION` via `src/lib/site.ts`.
- Product source of truth: `src/data/gear.json`. Reference products by **ID only** — never duplicate product fields into articles or components.
- Extend existing files; do not rewrite from scratch.
- Do **not** reintroduce HTML body rewrite middleware (`rewriteForUs`).

## Keep working

| Path | Role |
|---|---|
| `Layout.astro` | Nav, canonical/OG/Twitter/hreflang, Amazon footer disclosure |
| `ProductCard.astro` | Product display + affiliate CTA |
| `index.astro` | Homepage |
| `gear/[category].astro` | Paddles / shoes / nets |
| `src/content/articles` | MDX articles (typed content collection) |
| `src/components` | Reusable UI |
| `src/lib/seo.ts` | SEO / JSON-LD / hreflang helpers |

## Protected routes

`/`, `/gear/paddles`, `/gear/shoes`, `/gear/nets`, `/sitemap-index.xml` on **both** hosts.
